              {
                "WEMFile": 16291,
                "EmotionOut": 0,
                "ResponseText": "That array\u0027s been watching every hauler we load for a month, and now they\u0027ve parked a crew beside it. Take the scanners down, all of them, because the one you miss is the one that sees us leave.",
                "ScriptNotes": "",
                "Edits": "",
